Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:06.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A-A dolphin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:08.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Excuse me... Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Er, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:13.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I believe that the meeting\Nwill be starting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:18.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um... We apparently have\Nto decide who the Gnosia is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:20.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. My name is Otome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:28.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,An intellectualized dolphin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:35.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- I must seem strange, right?\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:42.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't understand humans very well,\Nso I always worry I'll say something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:43.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:45.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:47.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's honestly amazing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:50.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Depending on the world line, even a person {\i0}\N{\i1}like this can end up on the ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait... Should I even be calling her a person?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:58.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So these are the crew members this time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.55,0:02:32.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Setsu, Shigemichi,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:35.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stella, Jonas, Jina, and...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:37.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who's that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.09,0:02:40.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And who might you be, lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? M-Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:48.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Remnan has been on board for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:49.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.93,0:02:53.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um... I'm not very good at talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:56.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right. Well, let us begin without further ado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:03:01.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This time, there are apparently\Ntwo Gnosia amongst us...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:02.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:07.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um, I was wondering if I'd be\Nconsidered a human in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:10.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah, your appearance doesn't\Nreally scream "human" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:14.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound very convincing\Ncoming from you, Shigemichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:20.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I told you, this is all artificial skin.\NI wasn't born this way, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:24.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In any case, it's very likely that Otome\Ncan be infected by the Gnosia as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:27.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,She's intelligent and can\Nconverse with us just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:34.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I think that Otome is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.05,0:03:36.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:38.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get the meeting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:40.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:41.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:46.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It appears as though one of the {\i0}\N{\i1}crew members is still absent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You mean Sha-ming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have made multiple attempts to summon him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:54.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sha-ming... That's another new name.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:55.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:56.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:59.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Could you come with me for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:05.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I just have a really hard time\Ndealing with him one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:13.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The others say he's not a bad guy,\Nand while I understand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:18.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,the fact that he refuses to help\Nin this emergency situation is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:23.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sha-ming. Sha-ming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:31.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Heh, thought I'd be seein' you again. {\i0}\N{\i1}Come on in, Setsu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:36.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like I said, you wanna ask me for somethin', {\i0}\N{\i1}you gotta treat me to a hot kiss first.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:40.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sha-ming. How many times must\NI tell you that I'm asexual?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:46.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, long as it's you, I'd still hit it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:48.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, who's the other one?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:50.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never seen 'em before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:54.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Yuri. The meeting's about to start.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:55.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could you please come out?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:59.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you already. {\i0}\N{\i1}Just do your thing without me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:03.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I told {\i0}you{\i1} that we {\i0}\N{\i1}all need to have a meeting{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to decide on one person {\i0}\N{\i1}to send into cold sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's our agreement with LeVi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:10.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:14.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I just waltz out there and some Gnosia {\i0}\N{\i1}sets their eye on me, I could get eliminated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:18.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna stand out. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:21.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ooh, nice. I like that {\i0}\N{\i1}angry face of yours, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Listen!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:28.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's no use. This door's sealed {\i0}\N{\i1}by an unbreakable magic spell.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you don't come out,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:33.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you'll be causing trouble for everyone. {\i0}\N{\i1}You understand that, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:35.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yuri, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:38.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You seem like a self-serving hypocrite\Nwho's obsessed with logic and debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:40.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The type I hate the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:43.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you got a problem with me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:46.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just do your precious vote {\i0}\N{\i1}and send me to the fridge already.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:52.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I got too emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's head back to the meeting for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:01.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then we already have our answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:05.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We can simply vote for Sha-ming\Nand call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,LeVi, is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:11.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I mean, he said it himself,\Nso I don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:12.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:17.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no issue as long as everyone {\i0}\N{\i1}is satisfied with the voting results.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But is he really going to respect that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:24.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You weren't able to open the door, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:31.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If a day passes without sending {\i0}\N{\i1}someone into cold sleep,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:35.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it will be considered a breach of contract, {\i0}\N{\i1}and I will prepare the ship to self-destruct.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:37.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Self-destruct...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:42.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Our only choice is to vote for Sha-ming\Nand drag his ass outta that room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:46.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-I can't do that.\NI'm not good at fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:48.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and Sha-ming seems scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:54.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jonas, isn't there any way to open his door?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:07:02.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I assume that Sha-ming has\Ncut the door's control circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And if that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:05.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We'll need a physical key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:07.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Physical key?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:12.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As you can see, there is a hole in\Nthe door for inserting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:15.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you insert a matching key,\Nyou can unlock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:18.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The technology is quite dated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:21.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but this ship was retrofitted\Nfrom an older model.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:24.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So where is this key?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:26.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It should be somewhere in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:27.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:28.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:35.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I believe... it should be\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:39.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There seem to be a lot of\Nrare items laying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:43.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. It is Jonas's hobby\Nto collect antiques.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:49.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:51.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Oh, please do not touch those!\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:57.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Please wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:08:01.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Jonas will be angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:04.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What the heck, bud? Jonas this, Jonas that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, Jonas {\i1}is{\i0} the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Eek! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:15.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This will probably take some time,\Nso could you all head back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:17.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can handle this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:19.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Really? All by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:26.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I will be fine. This is my job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:31.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man, we can't just leave her like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:33.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But Stella says she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:37.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There were also people who felt bad\Nfor me when I was in captivity,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:39.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:43.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The researcher, Dr. Yoshikado,\Nis a really good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:45.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So we're just gonna leave her like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:50.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We're gonna let her spend her life slaving\Naway for the captain of this rust bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:52.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Here's your Space Bran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:09:00.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Man, that hits the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:04.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shigemichi, you must really like Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}'Course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:10.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because Stella said...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Cyberization?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:14.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:17.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,When I had no choice but to go with\Nthis artificial skin after the accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,it came up that I also had the option
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:22.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,to digitize my consciousness\Nby means of cyberization.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you have regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:28.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, sorta, when I think about\Nhow if I had chosen that path,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:32.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I probably wouldn't have gotten\Nmixed up in this whole Gnosia mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:36.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,This is just my personal opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:39.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but I think it's better that you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:45.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you had, I never would have been able to\Nspeak to you in that wonderful form of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:55.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I've been called a lot of things\Nin this skin, but wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:58.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now you see why I've fallen for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella's such a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Damn straight she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:08.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then I think you should tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:09.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:14.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I don't think Stella has realized\Nyour feelings for her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:15.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:18.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Otome... You're right. You're exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:19.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:21.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.76,0:10:26.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:29.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jonas...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:31.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:36.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We found the key, but the\Ndoor just wouldn't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:39.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The flustered crab cannot return to its hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:42.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let us see if we can come up\Nwith a new plan of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:45.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:50.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:56.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:04.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- I-I don't think you should lose hope.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:08.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Because this is the part\Nthat gets all "squee!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:13.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:18.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,F-F-F-Face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:19.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:26.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If I win, you're gonna\Nset Stella free! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:29.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh? W-Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Aren't you skipping a few steps here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:34.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shigemichi... you're wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:40.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I like your initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:43.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As a gentleman, I shall accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So... this is how you're\Ngoing to settle things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:49.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're not half bad, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:55.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're actually giving Game Captor S\Na run for his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:12:02.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No matter my opponent, I cannot\Nbe beaten at {\i1}WTF?! Human Farm{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have at least a century's experience, easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Amazing! What brilliant play from both of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can't believe I get to witness\Nsuch a clash of titans!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:18.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We're witnessing a match between\Nthe legendary Game Captor S
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:22.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and a crew member of the legendary\Nexploration vessel Argo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:31.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you with Satan's Naughty Satellite!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Superhuman Death Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:40.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what?! I... I los...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:42.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:43.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Urf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:46.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:51.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In the past, I probably would\Nhave lost under these conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:57.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But now that I have awakened\Nas a Gnosia, I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:58.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Uh.\N- Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait. Did you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:07.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,To think that I would be defeated...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:19.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Jonas was a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:22.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now there's only one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:25.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jonas was a Gnosia...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:29.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I challenged him\Nand uncovered the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Now you're free, Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:33.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Free...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:38.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Now you don't have to obey\Nthat mustached freak anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:41.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:48.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Um, what... are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Could we start off as friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:53.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- Friends?\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:57.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I've thought for a while now that we'd\Nprobably have a lot to talk about!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.09,0:13:59.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:04.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I also love flowers! I want to\Ngrow some flowers with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:06.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:07.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:19.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:22.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Poor Shigemichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can understand turning down a romantic\Nproposal, but not even wanting to be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:30.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't bring it back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:36.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:40.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,As it stands, I feel really\Nbad for Shigemichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:43.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I wish there was something I could do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:47.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but I don't know much about humans yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I-Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:54.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I heard... that you like fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:03.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't think of anything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:07.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike finding Gnosia, {\i0}\N{\i1}this can't be solved with logic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:09.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if there\Nwas anything we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:16.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,But no matter how much I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.05,0:15:19.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,relationships between men and\Nwomen really are complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:21.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:23.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:27.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I may not have a gender, but it\Ndoesn't mean I can't have feelings for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:28.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:32.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I decided to live like this\Nso that I could survive the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:34.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but with gender no longer in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}it feels like I have even more freedom\Nto follow my heart now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:45.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We were up there until\Nyesterday, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:47.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:53.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I see. It's only been a day\Nsince we departed, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:56.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah... But how many departures has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:01.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's hold off on exchanging\Ninformation this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:04.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,One of us may be a Gnosia, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:06.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:10.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Stella...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:14.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:18.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. Shigemichi absolutely\Ninsisted that I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.89,0:16:21.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Do you dislike Shigemichi that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:22.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.43,0:16:24.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I can understand declining\Na romantic relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:26.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but surely it's not asking much to be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:29.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that I dislike him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:34.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Actually, it made me very happy to have\Nsomeone feel that way toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:35.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Then why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:38.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Shigemichi hasn't realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:42.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Actually, you probably haven't either, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can you not tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:50.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:55.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes. This body of mine\Nis just another terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:58.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,In order to facilitate\Ncommunication with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:02.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,the ship's onboard AI, LeVi,\Ncreated a humanoid terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:04.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That is what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:06.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,"AI"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:10.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Short for "artificial intelligence."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:14.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,A technology that has evolved since it\Nwas first created a thousand years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:17.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,and is now on the same level\Nas human intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:20.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:25.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is the result of his\Ncountless times undergoing cold sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:30.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,but Jonas's thinking is stuck in the past,\Nand he doesn't seem to understand AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:34.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So to be able to communicate with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:38.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,we prepared the humanoid terminal "Stella."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:40.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So a part of LeVi is Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:44.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. That is correct.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:49.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Even then, Jonas always says\Nnonsensical things in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:53.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,thinking it's all part of some\NAI-assisted comedy routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:57.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,The one thing I am certain of\Nis that I am not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:02.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I am not fit to enter into relationships\Nwith others, either romantic or platonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:05.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can't say where, but I {\i1}have{\i0} seen you\Ninfected by the Gnosia before, Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Me? But... that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:18.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,And it's not just me.\NSetsu probably has, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:20.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Have you, Setsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:28.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,So I feel the same way that\NJina said she did about Otome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:31.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,About you, and Otome as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:33.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I believe you're both human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:48.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Really, Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If I would suffice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stella...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I, I, I, I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let us start off as friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:03.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:06.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I was born on an AI planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.59,0:19:10.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,My friends and family were AI. So I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Those two will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:16.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's with this hologram?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:20.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,When I asked LeVi to choose an appropriate\Nenvironment for a confession of feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:21.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,this is what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's really lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:27.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:40.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:45.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Jina was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, I do not sense her presence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:52.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I guess as long as there's a Gnosia present,\Nsomeone's going to get attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.43,0:19:54.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you wish to do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Could you give me just ten minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:03.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sha-ming! Sha-ming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:04.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:06.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, if it ain't Setsu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:09.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's up? Decided to give me that kiss?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:10.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:15.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you. Just vote me out already.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:16.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:17.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Otome...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:22.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}U-Um, my name is Otome.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:25.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Oh, the lab dolphin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:28.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Good for ya for bein' able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:31.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, no. I'm sure that everyone {\i0}\N{\i1}is worried about me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:34.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I'd like to return {\i0}\N{\i1}to the lab immediately.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:38.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess you're a research animal {\i0}\N{\i1}through and through.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:40.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure nothin' good awaits you back there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I disagree. Dr. Yoshikado is a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He always pats my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:50.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's only 'cuz your\Nintellectualization's goin' well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:53.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it starts failin', they'll throw {\i0}\N{\i1}your ass in the trash.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:55.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sha-ming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.55,0:21:00.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you might be wrong, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.39,0:21:03.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't think we'll ever know {\i0}\N{\i1}the answer unless we talk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:07.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think that's what it means to be human.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:11.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,If you still refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}then I want you to open the airlock\Nand leave this ship immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:16.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Everyone else who escaped onto this ship
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,has been dreaming about their futures\Nlike their lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.59,0:21:25.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,They're searching for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:31.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,We can't let all of that be lost just\Nbecause you choose to be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:41.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.18,0:21:47.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You're Sha-ming?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:50.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Yup. Pleasure meetin' ya, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:56.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,You were using that pipe\Nto keep the door shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.76,0:21:59.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:06.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Let's go get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll be outta your hair before ya know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:14.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you to just\Nfreeze me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:18.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Wait... did he just do that on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,Sha-ming...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:22.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,I think he might be a very good person!

